      "kind": "sound",
      "title": "Two consonants together",
      "text": "กลับ, ไกล, ใกล้, กลัว and ครับ each begin with two consonants said together, with no vowel between them: กล is gl-, คร is khr-. Look at the pair ไกล and ใกล้: the spelling differs only in the vowel letter (ไ or ใ, both ai) and in the mark ้ on the second. ไกล (far) is a plain mid tone; ใกล้ (near) is falling because of ้.",
